<%# How the map is made: draw it (this editor), or use a picture (later: the board drawn over an image of one's own,
    its grid set on it). A segmented switch like the theme selector (Anthony's request): on the field background, the
    chosen one in a surface pill. Drawing is the only way for now: the picture is disabled (faded, like a disabled
    field), with « Bientôt ». Real radio buttons without a name: nothing is sent, screen readers say the choice %>
<fieldset class="flex shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-field p-1">
  <legend class="sr-only"><%= t(".label") %></legend>
  <label class="<%= MapTemplatesHelper::MAKING_CHOICE_CLASSES %> cursor-default has-checked:bg-surface has-checked:font-semibold has-checked:shadow-sm">
    <input type="radio" checked class="sr-only" id="map-making-draw">
    <%= t(".draw") %>
  </label>
  <label class="<%= MapTemplatesHelper::MAKING_CHOICE_CLASSES %> cursor-not-allowed opacity-50">
    <input type="radio" disabled class="sr-only" id="map-making-picture">
    <%= t(".picture") %>
    <span class="rounded-full px-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase ring-1 ring-field-line ring-inset"><%= t(".coming_soon") %></span>
  </label>
</fieldset>
